# Backend (`backend/open_webui/`)

**Entry point:** `open_webui/__init__.py` — Typer CLI (`serve`, `dev`) launches `open_webui.main:app` via uvicorn.

**`main.py`** — Core FastAPI app: `lifespan()` startup/shutdown, route mounts under `/api/v1/`, `/ollama`, `/openai` passthrough, chat/completions proxies. Middleware stack: `RedirectMiddleware`, `SecurityHeadersMiddleware`, `CommitSessionMiddleware`, `AuthTokenMiddleware`, `WebsocketUpgradeGuardMiddleware`.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `config.py` | `ConfigVar` settings with env-var defaults |
| `env.py` | Bootstrap: `DATA_DIR`, `DATABASE_URL`, Redis, OAuth, logging |
| `internal/db.py` | SQLAlchemy async engine (SQLite/PostgreSQL/SQLCipher) |
| `internal/config.py` | `ConfigState` in-memory mirror of config DB row |
| `models/` | Peewee ORM (mirrors router files) |
| `routers/` | FastAPI CRUD per domain entity |
| `socket/main.py` | Socket.IO real-time events |
| `utils/` | `auth.py`, `asgi_middleware.py`, `retrieval/`, `tools.py`, `mcp/`, `telemetry/` |
| `migrations/` | Alembic (async-capable) |

Use pure-ASGI middleware (`asgi_middleware.py`); avoid `BaseHTTPMiddleware` (task-group cancellation issues).
